# A Pioneer's Best (Imaginary) Friend (adoulin 75, call-only), the rewards at fractional rates: a level 99 Warrior in
# Western Adoulin, EXP_RATE 1.125 and BAYLD_RATE 1.3125 (settings), the quest accepted and Ionis on (GMs). Merleg: 543,
# then 2522, finished: 500 * 1.125 = 562.5 exp (563: the binding rounds half away from zero), npcUtil.giveCurrency's 200
# * 1.3125 = 262.5 bayld (263, and BAYLD_OBTAINED 263), the badge, 30 fame.
lists WesternAdoulin/Merleg/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2522
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=32.5,0,-131 job=WAR lvl=99
setting EXP_RATE 1.125
setting BAYLD_RATE 1.3125
quest Adoulin.APioneersBestImaginaryFriend accepted
login
effect 512                              # a GM: Ionis
trigger Merleg                          # Ionis on: 2522 or 543
finish-if-event
trigger Merleg                          # the other; 2522's finish: 562.5 exp, 262.5 bayld
finish-if-event
